[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/pulls/62","id":5151373788,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUrsrDs8AAAABMwu53A","html_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/pull/62","diff_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/pull/62.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/pull/62.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/issues/62","number":62,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Run CI on claude-config's shell scripts through the shared shell check","user":{"login":"sh4i-yurei","id":232996764,"node_id":"U_kgDODeM_nA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232996764?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei","html_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"CI checked this repository's Python, but not its three shell scripts: `hooks/claude-autoformat.sh`, `skills/buildlog/scripts/new-buildlog.sh` and `tools/vault-env`. They had no Bats tests, and `vault-env`'s three tests were pytest tests that kcov can't see.\n\n- `ci.yml` gains a `shell` job calling the shared `shell.yml` at `58da91c`, the commit where the changed-lines gate counts an extensionless script such as `vault-env` as shell. It measures `hooks`, `skills/buildlog/scripts` and `tools`, with Bats tests from `tests/shell`.\n- Bats tests in `tests/shell/` describe what each script does today. One helper starts every script from an explicit environment, with a temporary `HOME` and kcov's four tracing variables passed through only when they're set. Without those variables, kcov loses the script.\n- `vault-env`'s tests move into Bats, and `tests/test_vault_env.py` is removed. The terminal case runs the script through `script`, with an empty standard input so it can't echo whatever input the runner happens to have.\n- `claude-autoformat.sh`'s tests use stand-in formatters on a PATH of their own, because `/usr/bin/gofmt` exists on the laptop.\n- The shell floor is 73, from CI's measured 73.6%. `vault-env`'s outside-container path runs only on a runner, so the laptop measures less. CI's floor step is the gate for the total.\n- `tests/test_ci_workflow.py`, `ARCHITECTURE.md` and `AGENTS.md` describe the shell job and the new test command.\n\nEvidence: CI run 41798766043 on `ea32da0` passed both jobs. The Python job printed `728 passed` and `coverage 69.6% meets floor 69%`. The shell job measured `new-buildlog.sh` and `claude-autoformat.sh` at `line-rate=\"1.000\"` and `vault-env` at `0.263`, and printed `coverage 73.6% meets floor 73%`. The full check passes locally: `728 passed`, 14 Bats cases, and `git diff --check` clean. All 14 cases also pass with a terminal attached. Review round 1 passed with four non-blocking findings, which are filed as a tech-debt issue.\n\nAfter this merges, `shell / checks` joins `python / checks` as a required check in the `main` ruleset.\n\nCloses #61\n","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:33:16Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:27:11Z","closed_at":"2026-11-04T13:27:08Z","merged_at":"2026-11-04T13:27:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"4dcfe841441289c182e6ac4aadba6f92a17e15a3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/p